- **Codex / Copilot CLI:** reads `AGENTS.md` (managed section written by `nanite install`).
- **Gemini CLI:** reads `GEMINI.md` (managed section written by `nanite install`).
- **Opencode CLI:** reads `OPENCODE.md` (managed section written by `nanite install`).
- **Direct CLI:** `nanite serve --project .` starts the Nanite agent server for this project.

The four CLI files above are kept in sync automatically by `nanite install`'s adapter pipeline. Edit your project content outside the `<!-- nanite:start --> ... <!-- nanite:end -->` markers — anything inside will be overwritten on the next install or refresh.

